+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Full decode_1 launch chain (combo-b1-chain-c320-fused-pre-pdl, module muse_full_decode_c320[f], log tag
+# [c320]). Class FD1 only (full decode, batch 1, tp8, d 64, page 1); every other class stays on master.
+# SOURCE A (full-decode1-cuda-splitkv-chunk320, impl 183eb55): split-KV kernel A with 320-token work items
+# (c320_attn_kernel<320, false>, the strided page-index loop) + a 512-thread combine
+# (c320_combine_kernel<320, 16, false>), grid 2 x SM. SOURCE C (full-decode1-sk-two-level-fused-preattn,
+# impl 2236339): the pre-attention work folded into kernel A (template flag FUSED, compiled only under
+# -DC320_FUSED): the raw bf16 q row rides item 0's page-index cp.async group; every CTA builds its q MMA
+# fragments in registers (scaleless RMSNorm eps 1e-5, e4m3 RTNE + SATFINITE, the column map of the smem path);
+# the CTA that owns the last item (key seq-1) also brings the raw new k/v heads and cache_loc[0], builds the
+# new row (k: RMSNorm per kv head over 64, / k_scale; v: / v_scale; e4m3 RTNE + SATFINITE, as master's
+# _pre_attention_kernel), overwrites key seq-1's slot of the landed ring stage in smem and stores the row at
+# cache_loc. SOURCE D (splitkv-pdl-attn-to-combine, impl 9b85387): griddepcontrol.launch_dependents at the end
+# of kernel A; the combine is launched with cudaLaunchKernelEx + programmatic stream serialization from its
+# own host entry point (c320_combine_pdl, no per-call fallback), and its graph-input reads (seqlens, v_scale,
+# gate) sit above griddepcontrol.wait, every workspace read below it.
+# Variants: V0 master [pre-attn + two-level], V1 [pre-attn + A + combine], V2 V1 + PDL, V3 [A FUSED +
+# combine], V4 V3 + PDL. Import-time phases run after master's whole sequence, each started only when the
+# import clock (IMPORT_T0, the module's first statement) + its deadline <= 480 s: build (120 s; FUSED
+# build, else one non-FUSED rebuild), checks (60 s: eager correctness + two-state A B B A A B capture-once
+# replays through kernel_fn per variant; PDL survives only if its capture/replay passed), gate (60 s: all
+# variants interleaved, cold L2, empty graph subtracted, 41 reps; pass-1 best vs V0 and V1, 31 reps; route
+# only if best / V0 <= 0.98). The route (_C320_FN) is frozen once at the end.
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+_C320_CHUNK = 320       # must match CHUNK_B1 in the CUDA source
+_C320_BUDGET = 480.0    # s of import clock by which every added phase must be able to finish
+_C320_GATE = 0.98       # route the best variant only if best / V0 <= this (head-to-head pass)
+_C320_EXT = None        # the c320 module (None until built and initialised)
+_C320_SOURCES = {0: "master pre-attn + two-level", 1: "A", 2: "A+D", 3: "A+C", 4: "A+C+D"}
